### CollectionPoints — PHYSICAL DELETE (expects 200 OK; 404 when missing)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002
@id = 1

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/collection-points/{{id}}

### Routes — PHYSICAL DELETE of a route that still has collection points (expects 409 Conflict)
@routeId = 1

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/routes/{{routeId}}
